    <item>
      <title>Thunderstorm Advisory No. 1 #SLPRSD</title>
      <description>Thunderstorm Advisory No. 1 #SLPRSD&lt;br /&gt; Issued at 02:10 PM 23 August 2026&lt;br /&gt; &lt;br /&gt; Moderate to heavy rainshowers with lightning and strong winds are expected over #NorthernSamar(Catubig, LasNavas and SilvinoLobos) within the next 1 to 2 hours.&lt;br /&gt; &lt;br /&gt; The above conditions are being experienced in #NorthernSamar(Mapanas, Gamay and Lapinig) which may persist within 1 to 2 hours and may affect nearby areas.&lt;br /&gt; &lt;br /&gt; All are advised to take precautionary measures against the impacts associated with these hazards which include flash floods and landslides.&lt;br /&gt; &lt;br /&gt; Keep monitoring for updates.</description>
      <pubDate>Sun, 23 Aug 2026 06:10:01 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">9376fd66fc081987f5042e568320468a6fc52344</guid>
      <category>Thunderstorm Advisory</category>
      <ns0:seen xmlns:ns0="https://pagasa-feeds.local/ns">Sun, 23 Aug 2026 09:02:16 +0000</ns0:seen>
    </item>
